ent-helpsheet\">HS220: More than one business</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/how-to-calculate-your-taxable-profits-hs222-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS222: How to calculate your taxable profits</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farmers-and-market-gardeners-hs224-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS224: Farmers and market gardeners</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/capital-allowances-and-balancing-charges-hs252-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS252: Capital allowances and balancing charges</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/information-from-your-accounts-hs229-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS229: Information from your accounts</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farm-stock-valuation-hs232-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS232: Farm stock valuation</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/averaging-for-creators-of-literary-or-artistic-works-hs234-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS234: Averaging for creators of literary or artistic works</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/qualifying-care-relief-foster-carers-adult-placement-carers-kinship-carers-and-staying-put-carers-hs236-self-assessment-helpsheet\">HS236: Qualifying care relief: Foster carers, adult placement carers, kinship carers and staying put carers</a></p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Self-employment (full) form and notes for the tax year 2025 to 2026 have been added. The forms and notes for tax year 2021 to 2022 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:21Z"},{"note":"The form and self-employment (full) notes have been added for tax year 2024 to 2025. Versions from tax year 2020 to 2021 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The form and self-employment (full) notes have been added for tax year 2023 to 2024.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"no